<title>POLAND: Sokolow Q3 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Sokolow Q3 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sokolow SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				3.43   vs    7.82</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  3.36   vs    3.71</p>
<p>    net					1.77   vs    1.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     66.87   vs   48.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales			57.06   vs   40.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.59   vs    2.05</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   5.99   vs    2.53</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.40   vs    0.30</p>
<p>    investment			     4.21   vs    1.39</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>NOTE - Net profit for nine months includes deferred tax provissions amounting to 0.7 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    operating				9.54   vs    4.29</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 10.06   vs    7.56</p>
<p>    net					6.03   vs    4.59</p>
<p>    net sales			    173.36   vs  125.83</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     146.43   vs  106.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     4.03   vs    2.97</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   8.26   vs    6.78</p>
<p>    financial costs			7.74   vs    3.51</p>
<p>    investment			    16.72   vs    4.65</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
